This project is a MoonBit re-implementation of tinyhttpd, the classic
minimal HTTP server written in 1999 by J. David Blackstone:

  https://sourceforge.net/projects/tinyhttpd/

The original software is copyright 1999 by J. David Blackstone and is
distributed under the terms of the GNU General Public License. This
port is therefore licensed under the GNU General Public License v2.0
or later (see LICENSE).

The TCP shim in server/ffi_tcp_native.c and all MoonBit sources in
this repository were written for this project; no original C code was
copied. tinyhttpd's design (accept loop, request parsing, CGI
scripting, error pages) is what this project intentionally preserves.
